Vallado's SGP4 verification cases and output
============================================

SGP4-VER.TLE holds the verification cases of "Revisiting Spacetrack Report #3" (AIAA
2006-6753), and tcppver.out the output of Vallado's C++ test program for them, in AFSPC
mode ('a') with the WGS-72 constants. test_sgp4 checks the vendored SGP4 against them.

Both are unmodified: byte for byte as distributed, CRLF line endings included
(.gitattributes keeps Git from converting them). tcppver.out ends with a truncated line
with no line ending, which test_sgp4 skips.

Source      AIAA-2006-6753.zip, directory cpp/TestSGP4/TestSGP4/
            https://celestrak.org/publications/AIAA/2006-6753/AIAA-2006-6753.zip
Revision    Vallado's 2015 Dec 07 release
